Frame Work Structure :
my-playwright-project/
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       └── playwright.yml         # CI/CD pipeline configuration
├── page-objects/                  # Page Object Model (POM) classes
│   ├── LoginPage.ts
│   └── DashboardPage.ts
├── tests/                         # Test suites / spec files
│   ├── auth/
│   │   └── login.spec.ts
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── dashboard.spec.ts
├── fixtures/                      # Custom test fixtures (POM injection, API helpers)
│   └── baseTest.ts
├── test-data/                     # Environment data, JSON mocks, static data
│   ├── env.dev.json
│   └── users.json
├── utils/                         # Helper functions, DB setup, custom loggers
│   └── apiHelper.ts
├── playwright.config.ts           # Global Playwright configuration
├── package.json                   # Dependencies and npm scripts
└── .env                           # Environment variables (secrets, base URLs)